**Design rationale:**
- "Find" tasks use **observation-based** criteria (block visible in frame)
- "Mine" tasks use **inventory-based** criteria (item obtained after breaking block)
- "Craft" tasks use **inventory-based** criteria (crafted item appears in inventory)
- Yellow dye and red sandstone can be crafted in the 2×2 player inventory grid (no crafting table needed)
- Acacia fence requires the 3×3 crafting table grid (crafting table is provided at ~0,0,~2)

